      "reason": "Sink dereferences rettv->vval.v_partial, whose only provenance in the fragment is the out-parameter rettv set to VAR_UNKNOWN at line 20 (vval untouched) and the unshown callee get_lambda_tv at line 152; no shown statement excludes a NULL v_partial, and the guard at line 153 ('if (ret == OK && evaluate)') constrains only the int ret and evaluate flag, a different variable than the consumed pointer (IDENTITY failure). The missing fix is a NULL check on rettv->vval.v_partial (or pt_func) before the dereference; the witness rettv->vval.v_partial == NULL is admitted by every guard on the path, so the path reaches an unprotected NULL dereference, CWE-476."
    }
